# Armory Mice {1}{W}, a 3/1: "Celebration — This creature gets +0/+2 as long as two or more nonland permanents entered the
# battlefield under your control this turn." On turn three Bot1 plays a Plains and casts the Mice: a land and one nonland permanent,
# so 3/1. A Memnite entering after them is the second nonland permanent, so 3/3. The Mox Pearl of turn one doesn't count on turn
# three: the Mice are 3/1 again at the start of turn five, where a Plains and a Memnite are still one nonland permanent (3/1)
# and an Ornithopter is the second (3/3).

